Z||000002||rogergarrison||08-21-2001||09:29 PM||||hey welcome<BR> <BR>for stock 2.8, you could go with larger throttle body, your going to have to upgrade to a high performance coil too. The stock coils are crap. K&N air filter is good too. remove the baffle in the air intake inside the drivers side air intake. Good set of spark plug wires if yours are very old. All pretty cheap pepperuppers and ez to do. <P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=11878523&p=52990885"> ||||reg||1
