Z||000005||grinthock||08-21-2001||09:33 PM||||Well if it's a 4-spd manual, you should be able to get down to 15.3 real easy.... Some basic stuff<P>K&N Air filter intake kit (not just filter)<BR>K&N Breather<BR>Rapid Fire Plugs<BR>8.8 MM Wires<BR>MSD Box<BR>Blaster Coil<P><BR>If the engine comes out you could do a CAM that's cheap, even with it in you could do roller rockers if you are so inclined....<P>LOTS to do.... HAve fun||||reg||1
