Z||000008||Oreif||08-21-2001||11:08 PM||||Go to:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com" TARGET=_blank>www.v8archie.com</A> <P>He can make a Fiero get into the 12's!<BR>All you need is $$$$$     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Stock V-6's can get you into the 200's for HP, but for the cost, Engine swaps are the easiest way to go fast. The popular swaps are a 3800 with a supercharger out of a Grand Prix GTP or simular, A chevy 350 V-8, or A Northstar V-8. ||||reg||1
